.DS_Store
/vendor
/.idea
/.vscode
/.zed

# The board is derived from app/dev/tasks by `bin/tasks`. It used to be
# committed, and every claim or close rewrote its count line and re-sorted its
# tables, so two people finishing on one day conflicted in a file neither had
# edited. Render it locally; CI prints it as a job summary.
app/dev/BOARD.md

# Screenshots are evidence for whoever is reading a report on the machine that
# produced them, and a repository of PNGs of a dialog box helps nobody a year
# later. A report has to stand on its own in words.
app/**/*.png
app/**/*.jpg
app/**/*.jpeg
app/**/*.gif
app/**/*.webp
app/**/*.mp4
app/**/*.mov

# ...except the brand assets, which are the deliverable rather than evidence.
!app/design/brand/**

# Design-review runs written by `php artisan qori:design-review` in the code
# repository. Ignored for the same reason task-report evidence is.
/app/design/reviews/runs/
.phpunit.result.cache
